        "language": "java",
        "content": "class Parent {\n    // Instance method for Overriding\n    public void showMessage() {\n        System.out.println(\"Parent instance method\");\n    }\n\n    // Static method for Hiding\n    public static void display() {\n        System.out.println(\"Parent static method\");\n    }\n}\n\nclass Child extends Parent {\n    @Override\n    public void showMessage() {\n        System.out.println(\"Child instance method (Overridden)\");\n    }\n\n    // This hides Parent.display(), it does not override it\n    public static void display() {\n        System.out.println(\"Child static method (Hidden)\");\n    }\n}\n\npublic class DispatchDemo {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Parent obj = new Child();\n        obj.showMessage(); // Outputs: Child instance method (Dynamic Dispatch)\n        obj.display();     // Outputs: Parent static method (Static Binding)\n    }\n}"
