        "content": "public int maxSubArray(int[] nums) {\n    int maxSoFar = nums[0], currentMax = nums[0];\n    for (int i = 1; i < nums.length; i++) {\n        currentMax = Math.max(nums[i], currentMax + nums[i]);\n        maxSoFar = Math.max(maxSoFar, currentMax);\n    }\n    return maxSoFar;\n}"
